# Default C/C++ style for anything under $HOME without its own .clang-format
# (a project's file, being closer, still wins). LLVM, but 4-space indent to
# match nvim's shiftwidth; access modifiers stay flush left (LLVM's -2 was
# tuned for 2-space indent).
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 4
AccessModifierOffset: -4
